---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Public Land Lovers.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap content-body">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Public Land Lovers</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Replace this with your real story: how the road trips started, why
        public lands and the wild horse &amp; burro program matter to you,
        and how the GIS work behind the scenes connects to it all.
      </p>
      <p>
        A short second paragraph on Orovada Consulting LLC and how it
        relates to this project works well here too &mdash; the throughline
        from "we map public lands for love" to "we also do this
        professionally" is the whole point of this site.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .content-body { max-width: 40rem; }
  .lede { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 1.05rem; }
</style>
